  dialogueId: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: The statue, now whole, breathed a light of its own.
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: And in the mirrored walls a new passage was revealed...
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: ...and the two walked through.
